    "title": "Meta’s Muse AI allegedly shares user’s home address and arranges pickup without permission",
    "summary": "The incident underscores the urgent need for stricter AI governance and user consent protocols to prevent privacy breaches and maintain trust.\nThe post Meta’s Muse AI allegedly shares user’s home address and arranges pickup without permission appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/meta-muse-ai-shares-user-address/",
    "source": "CryptoBriefing",
    "tags": [
      "Meta"
